# true-enchants: the saved game the true-enchants enhanced session starts from. A new character,
# as the newgame session makes one (every default, the name Avatar); then a test's cheats
# (EXHUME_TEST_CHEATS=1; recording format 6): two longswords with weapon enchantments, as a level
# stores them (give ITEM enchant N), effect 2, which the game names Great Accuracy but which adds
# damage, and effect 6, named Great Damage but adding to hit (combat/COMBAT.C's DoPlayerWeapon),
# and two scrolls of Name Enchantment (spell 34, give ITEM spell N), into the pack. Saved in slot
# 1, described "names"
14000 key esc
16500 key esc
20000 key enter        # Create Character
24000 key enter        # every default: sex, handedness, class, the skills, the portrait,
27000 key enter        # the difficulty
30000 key enter
33000 key enter
36000 key enter
39000 key enter
42000 key enter
45000 key enter
48000 key a            # the name
48200 key v
48400 key a
48600 key t
48800 key a
49000 key r
50000 key enter
53000 key enter        # Yes
60000 cheat give 0x005 enchant 2
60100 cheat give 0x005 enchant 6
60200 cheat give 0x136 1 spell 34
60300 cheat give 0x136 1 spell 34
64000 down ctrl        # save: Ctrl+S, slot 1, "names"
64100 key s
64300 up ctrl
66000 key enter
67500 key n
67700 key a
67900 key m
68100 key e
68300 key s
69000 key enter
